@@s001 What machine learning is
@@s002 dato:what we give the computer,ok:what we get
@@s003 ora:current step,dato:the right answers,ok:result
@@s004 dato:class A (or group 1),due:class B (or group 2),ok:the learned rule
@@s005 dato:data collected,ok:estimated model,no:model that memorises,spento:true function
